{"description":"Cere echipei platformei s\u0103 scrie articolul: tem\u0103, tip de campanie, lungime, cuv\u00e2nt-cheie, brand, adresa promovat\u0103, fapte. Se pl\u0103te\u0219te din sold. Merge doar cu comutatorul pentru asisten\u021bi AI pornit.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"adresaPromovata":{"format":"uri","type":"string"},"brand":{"maxLength":120,"type":"string"},"campaignId":{"format":"uuid","type":"string"},"campaignType":{"enum":["SEO","BRAND_AWARENESS","PRESS_RELEASE","BRAND_MENTION","CASINO","CRYPTO","ADULT"],"type":"string"},"cuvantCheie":{"maxLength":120,"type":"string"},"cuvinte":{"enum":[500,700,1000,1500],"type":"number"},"fapte":{"items":{"maxLength":400,"minLength":3,"type":"string"},"maxItems":20,"type":"array"},"idempotencyKey":{"maxLength":200,"type":"string"},"note":{"maxLength":2000,"type":"string"},"tema":{"maxLength":200,"minLength":10,"type":"string"}},"required":["tema"],"type":"object"},"name":"order_writing","title":"Comand\u0103 redactarea unui articol (cheltuie\u0219te)"}
